     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Comment from Sourceforge Task&#93;</span><br/>\nComment Submitter: eddie<br/>\nTemporarily suspending development on this task as it isn't going to make it for 3.0.</p>\n\n<p>For future reference:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Added new CXF libraries</li>\n\t<li>Updated lib.properties</li>\n\t<li>build.xml changes include:<br/>\nclasspath and wsdl2java macrodef</li>\n\t<li>updated web.xml</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The stubwrappers target and related are still Axis-specific and need reworking.</p>",
